  "notes": "Q1 2026 showed strong revenue growth of 20% YoY, driven primarily by acquisitions (809M in total consideration) with 6% organic growth reported. Maintenance revenue, representing 77% of total revenue, grew 22% YoY but organic growth decelerated to 4% FX-neutral from 6% in Q4 2025. Net income surged 170% to $367M with EPS of $17.32. Free cash flow available to shareholders increased 44% to a record $733M. Net debt improved to $980M from $1,043M at year-end 2025. The Synchronoss acquisition via Lumine (completed Feb 13) for $309M was the largest transaction in the quarter. Average historical maintenance organic growth has been 4.8% since Q1 2019, indicating Q1 2026 was below historical average. Recurring revenue organic growth has decelerated from 6% (Q4 2025) to 4% (Q1 2026).",
